    "title": "MICROSERVICE-PROD-Create Pisp Domestic Payment-spec",
    "description": "The PISP Domestic Payment Submission API allows clients to securely initiate domestic payment transactions through a third-party provider's interface. This API facilitates the transfer of funds by interacting with the bank's payment systems, ensuring compliance with open banking regulations. Typical consumers include fintech applications and payment service providers that require seamless payment solutions for their users. The API supports essential operations for submitting and managing domestic payment requests, aiming to enhance user experience and transaction efficiency.",
